# Waikiki Dental content

- Edit practice facts, services, hours, bios, and CTAs in `src/lib/site.ts`, not by scattering copy through components.
- Keep brand tokens in `src/app/globals.css` (Pacific blue `#0051ae`, hibiscus coral). Do not invent a second palette.
- Imagery is real practice photography or original abstract art only (see `scripts/generate-abstract-art.py`). No AI-generated or stock people, patients, or treatment rooms.
- Never fabricate review counts, credentials, insurance, or clinical outcomes. `reviewStats` holds verified Google figures dated by `verifiedOn`; re-verify before changing them.
- Service menu: no dental bonding; crowns are traditional two-visit crowns only. Never advertise same-day/CEREC crowns.
- Do not submit the live Formspree appointment form unless the user explicitly requests a clinic-approved test.
- `waikikidental.com` is the live production domain. Verify it after every release; a push alone does not deploy.
- Aim copy at IV sedation and higher-ticket care, not general-dentistry volume.
- Coral is reserved for **Request Appointment**, which routes to the custom
  on-site form at `/request-appointment/`. Secondary is **Call or text**. Do
  not introduce an external booking-system link or put the contact form on the
  homepage.
- This repo is Waikiki Dental only. Sacramento Dental Medicine lives in `enzo-prism/sacramento-dental-medicine-redesign`.
